      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Ananalgestic effect of different processed products of Sparganium stoloniferum in mice is observed in hot plate and acetic acid induced writhing test, The experimental results shows that water extract of S. stoloniferum and its processed products can inhibit the pain. The analgestic effect of its processed product with vinegar is the most powerful and lasting."},
